WEBVTT

00:03:57.921 --> 00:04:00.358
Na kuzindua mikakati,
kubadilisha sera,

00:04:00.382 --> 00:04:02.270
Kuanzisha mazungumzo ya kitaifa

00:04:02.294 --> 00:04:05.548
ambayo yataanza kuamsha uelewa
juu ya safari ya kubadili mitazamo

00:04:05.572 --> 00:04:07.387
na kufanya iwe haikubaliki kijamii

00:04:07.411 --> 00:04:10.211
kuwa na ukatili na unyanyasaji wa watoto
katika nchi.

00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:13.832
Inamaanisha kutambua kuwa
ukatili dhidi ya watoto

00:04:13.856 --> 00:04:15.418
upo katika nyanja zote,

00:04:15.442 --> 00:04:18.918
na hivyo mwitikio, na jibu,
inabidi liwe na namna ya mfumo.

00:04:18.942 --> 00:04:21.204
Huwezi tu kufanya kipengele kimoja.

00:04:21.228 --> 00:04:23.998
Inahitaji wadau mbalimbali ndani
na nje ya serikali.

00:04:24.022 --> 00:04:26.491
Inahitaji vikundi vya kidini,
sekta binafsi na vyombo vya habari,

00:04:26.515 --> 00:04:29.503
wanazuoni, asasi za kiraia
na wengine.